  "description": "Conversion of ancillary staff accommodation on the upper floors of the Infant School building to provide educational facilities",
  "development_type": "Minor all other minor developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the end of three years from the date of this permission.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with the provisions of Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans: 8321-ID-RB-00-DR-I-0103 Rev P01, 8321-ID-RB-00-DR-I-0104 Rev P01, 250562_01 - Junior School, 250562_02 - Junior School, 250562_03 - Junior School, 250562_04- Junior School, 250562_05- Junior School, 250562_01 - Infant School, 250562_02 - Infant School, 250562_03 - Infant School, 250562_04 - Infant School, 250562_05 - Infant School, 8321-ID-RB-00-DR-I-6001 Rev P01, 8321-ID-RB-00-DR-I-6002 Rev P01, 8321-ID-RB-00-DR-I-3501 Rev P01, Planning Statement Boyer 16/02/2026, Transport Statement Odyssey February 2026, School Travel Plan Odyssey February 2026. \r\n\r\nReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interest of proper planning.\r\n",
    "Condition : 3 - All new external work shall be carried out in materials that resemble, as closely as possible, in colour and texture those of the existing building, unless otherwise specified in the approved application. \r\n\r\nReason: To safeguard the appearance of the premises and the character of the immediate area in accordance with the requirements of policies D1 and D2 of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017. \r\n"
  ],
